# Large, fully reproducible generated artifacts -- regenerate with
# `python scripts/run_pipeline.py` (deterministic, SEED=42). Excluded
# because sensor_telemetry.csv exceeds GitHub's 100MB hard limit and
# anomalies.csv sits right at the risky-file threshold. The small raw
# CSVs (asset_metadata/asset_connectivity/weather) stay tracked since
# they're a few KB-1MB and let a reviewer inspect real data without
# running anything.
data/raw/sensor_telemetry.csv
data/raw/sensor_telemetry.parquet
data/processed/
dashboard/anomalies.csv
dashboard/anomalies.parquet

